{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Claw your way to glory in this fast-paced 2D platformer-shooter adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a fearless feline on a mission through <strong>six action-packed worlds</strong>, each teeming with enemies, hazards, and hidden treasures. Jump, slide, and blast your way through vibrant retro-style levels, collecting <strong>coins and rare gems</strong> to upgrade your abilities and become more powerful.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With tight controls, challenging platforming, and explosive combat, every level is a test of skill and reflexes. Upgrade your cat's powers\u2014from a basic pistol to a fully automatic weapon, double jumps and bubble shield \u2014 as you prepare to face off against world bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a casual cat lover or a hardcore arcade veteran, this game delivers the perfect mix of challenge, charm, and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Think you're done? Think again.</strong> Beat the first five worlds and unlock a hidden vault of\u00a0<strong>nine bonus arcade-style minigames</strong> and an additional world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your reflexes and rack up high scores in quirky minigames like <strong>Coconut Catch</strong>, where timing is everything, or <strong>Ice Climb</strong>, a vertical sprint through slippery chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each minigame offers a fresh twist on the core mechanics, with online leaderboards so you can <strong>compete with friends and claw your way to the top</strong>. These bite-sized challenges are the perfect way to test your skills and keep the fun going long after the final boss is defeated.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Cat Gunner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3819280/7af892b5d67f980a4d9b3ab024f0acea82